# SKYWELL: a jelly splits in two when shot; squids can be bounced on;
# minnows can be stood on.
game skywell
wait 5
press A
cheat level 3
cheat clear
cheat god
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
wait 2
cheat pos 100 -12
cheat foe 2 96 -70
wait 2
hold UP+B 24
expect foe_2 == 0
expect foe_3 >= 1
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
cheat foe 1 90 -40
cheat pos 100 -60
